						<th class="fullWidth" style="width:40px">
						<table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%">
							<tbody>
								<tr>
									<td align="center" class="pad-0-20-20-20" style="padding: 0 0 20px 40px;width:40px;"><img alt="." border="0" src="https://campaign.edenred.be/images/TEMPLATE/2023_MASTER_TEMPLATE/default-icoStar.png" style="display: block;width:40px;" width="40" /></td>
								</tr>
							</tbody>
						</table>
						</th>
						<th>
						<table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%">
							<tbody>
								<tr>
									<td class="fz-p ta-c pad-0-20-20-20" style="font-family: 'Ubuntu', Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 18px; color: #000000; font-size: 15px;font-weight: 400; text-align: left;padding:0 40px 20px 70px;">Vous aurez la meilleure carte du march&eacute; en poche : la seule dot&eacute;e de la <strong>technologie Mastercard</strong>, donc &agrave; vous le paiement sans contact, via smartphone, en ligne, etc.</td>
								</tr>
